# Hello, I'm Abel!
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/public-profile/settings?trk=d_flagship3_profile_self_view_public_profile"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-LinkedIn-0A66C2?&style=for-the-badge&logo=linkedin&logoColor=white"></a>

I recently obtained a certificate in analysis and operationlal cybersecurity in the <a href= "https://www.polymtl.ca/">University of Polytechnique Montreal</a> and I have been acquiring hands on experience on my own doing CTF's on websites like <a href="https://app.hackthebox.com/home">Hackthebox</a> or working on my own virtual Lab.

## Objective

My Journey has been full of bumps and that's what made me so passionate about cybersecurity. It's a forever evolving field and there is not one that gos by without me learning something new. I aspire to get into the field to showcase my experience and acquire some as well.

